[statement]
As `a-condition-s-negated-entry-keeps-its-name-out-of-the-package-s-dependencies`,
where the dependency has another candidate: `e` needs `Q`, which `docs`
provides at 2 and `q2` at 1; apk passes over `docs`, whose name `e`'s
condition forbids, and installs `q2` with `e`.

[repository]
P:top
V:1
D:base

P:base
V:1

P:docs
V:2
p:Q=2

P:q2
V:1
p:Q=1

P:e
V:1
D:Q
i:base !docs

[request]
top

[answer apk-tools 3.0.9-r0]
install base 1
install q2 1
install e 1
install top 1
